  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>This is a linear differential&nbsp;equation.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Then solution of&nbsp;differential&nbsp;equation is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
